# Optional server-side fallback / demo seed — NOT required to run the app.
# The primary way to connect is the in-app login screen (enter org/project/PAT,
# stored in the browser, switch between multiple connections). If these are
# set, the app auto-seeds a default connection on first run with an EMPTY
# stored PAT, so the proxy uses this ADO_PAT server-side instead — the PAT
# never enters the browser for that seeded connection. Useful for a personal
# quick-start or for hosting (e.g. the cloudflared demo) where you don't want
# a PAT sitting in every visitor's localStorage.
ADO_ORG=contoso
ADO_PROJECT=Contoso.MyProject
ADO_TEAM=
ADO_PAT=
ADO_BASE_URL=https://dev.azure.com
ADO_ME=            # optional: your ADO uniqueName (email), e.g. _First.Last.ext.AZ@example.com — highlights cards assigned to you. Non-secret.
